# Work in small, testable changes

- Split work into the smallest task that can be verified on its own.
- Change only the files that task requires.
- Do not bundle unrelated refactors, dependency updates, formatting sweeps, or drive-by cleanup.
- Define how the task will be tested before editing, then run that check before starting the next task.
